flowchart TD

A[New FHIR Resource]

A --> B[Run generate-resources]

A --> C[Run generate-mappings]

A --> D[Run generate-scopes]

A --> E[Run generate-config]

E --> F[Generated Config]

C --> G[Generated Mapping]

F --> H[Developer Override]

G --> I[Hand Edit Mapping if Needed]

H --> J[Resource Registry]

I --> J

J --> K[Resource Available]